# Host build output: a copied obj folder carries Windows package paths and breaks the publish step
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults

# Editor and user files
.vs
.vscode
.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Secrets and local settings: they must not reach the build context, where COPY . . would put
# them into a cached build layer.
# appsettings.json stays in the context on purpose: it is the tracked base configuration
# (defaults only, no secrets). A server puts its own settings on top through a mounted file.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/appsettings.*.json
